"[CE] Gate icon-only styles properly behind its feature flag" (crbugs
578840597 and 579812417, "IconOnly mode is not properly guarded by its
flag"): the UA style sheet applied displaymode="icon-only" to the
<geolocation>, <camera>, <microphone> and <permission> capability elements
even though CapabilityElementIconOnlyMode is off, so any page could hide such
a permission element's text and leave only its icon, while 157 ships the
elements themselves. The icon-only rules are now inside
@supports blink-feature(CapabilityElementIconOnlyMode). chromium/src main
commit c850d0adde4d2a81b002ab0778b182c88aaeddfb, merged on 2026-11-03 to 157
(e8097a685d75165e187b0086415439b07e7871a3, after the 157.0.8103.41 tag).
This is the 157 merge, without its tests. Drop it once a 157 tag has it.

